{
    "title": "Guess the Spot - GeoGuess Game",
    "description": "Introducing Guess the Spot: A geographic trivia tour around the world.\r\n\r\nTake a virtual Geoguess tour, from big cities in the US to the Australian outback, from the fjords in Norway to the tip of South Africa. And maybe even Antartica.\r\n\r\nEach round we show you a set of 5 panoramic views in the category you picked. Have a look, roam the streets, and when you\u2019re ready\u2026 take a guess. The closer you guess, the more points you get! Pick a continent, country or one of the theme packs. Brave enough? How about \"The World\" as your playground?\r\n\r\nTake your time or do a speed run, by yourself or in a challenge with friends or strangers, and work your way up the leaderboards.\r\n\r\nHappy guessing!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Single player mode with category selection\r\n- Challenge mode\r\n- Timed Mode\r\n- Daily challenges for bonus points\r\n- Can't figure out the location? Use a hint!\r\n- Multiplayer matchmaking\r\n- Leaderboard (global & weekly)\r\n- Resume a game later",
    "descriptionHTML": "Introducing Guess the Spot: A geographic trivia tour around the world.<br><br>Take a virtual Geoguess tour, from big cities in the US to the Australian outback, from the fjords in Norway to the tip of South Africa. And maybe even Antartica.<br><br>Each round we show you a set of 5 panoramic views in the category you picked. Have a look, roam the streets, and when you\u2019re ready\u2026 take a guess. The closer you guess, the more points you get! Pick a continent, country or one of the theme packs. Brave enough? How about &quot;The World&quot; as your playground?<br><br>Take your time or do a speed run, by yourself or in a challenge with friends or strangers, and work your way up the leaderboards.<br><br>Happy guessing!<br><br>Features:<br>- Single player mode with category selection<br>- Challenge mode<br>- Timed Mode<br>- Daily challenges for bonus points<br>- Can&#39;t figure out the location? Use a hint!<br>- Multiplayer matchmaking<br>- Leaderboard (global &amp; weekly)<br>- Resume a game later",
